{
  "title": "ask.created@4",
  "description": "An ask was created. It always ends: it has a deadline, a fallback and a default. A taste call over candidates names the ones dropped before the ask as near copies of a candidate it keeps. An unblock task has at least one step and unblocks at least one thing, and a task with a cost you pay names its price. An authority ask, a taste call, a choice or a definition may name its subject in structured fields, and the core then sets its key from the subject alone, never from the question's words.",
